An Access Group Member resource defines the membership of a Vercel user (by their user ID) in a <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`vercel.AccessGroup`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`vercel.AccessGroup`" pulumi-lang-go="`AccessGroup`" pulumi-lang-python="`AccessGroup`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`vercel.AccessGroup`" pulumi-lang-java="`vercel.AccessGroup`">`vercel.AccessGroup`</span>.

